{"id": "66232", "title": "穿越农家之猛男", "author": "老胡图", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 56, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "连载中", "source": "files/article/info/66/66232.htm", "intro": "龙云飞本是清华计算机系大三的学生，学业成绩非常突出，一次意外，让他穿越回了八十年代的农村，这个农家孩子，利用自己掌握的知识，成就了一番大事业，其间，也同时获得了众多美女的芳心。\r\n小姨，邻家二丫，美女老师，乡医院的护士，信用社的美女副主任，乡妇联主任，包村的美女乡长……呜呜呜，怎么她们都缠着我不放呢？龙云飞一边郁闷，一边也习惯了拥有她们的美好生活。\r\n哎呀，前面那个美女，走路的姿势怎么那么好看呢？龙云飞赶紧追上去……\r\n神啊，我必须买台电脑，将老婆们和儿女们的名字存进去，以便检索！嘎嘎，生活啊，难道就是让我为这些女人们服务的吗？龙云飞觉得自己实在是太忙了，简直都没有功夫喘口气儿。", "base": "files/article/html/66/66232", "chapters": [{"title": "1-10", "file": "9953527.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-20", "file": "9953528.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-30", "file": "9953529.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "9953530.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-39", "file": "9953531.html", "available": false}, {"title": "40-43", "file": "9953532.html", "available": false}, {"title": "44-45", "file": "9953533.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-48", "file": "9953534.html", "available": false}, {"title": "49-51", "file": "9953535.html", "available": false}, {"title": "52-55", "file": "9953536.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-57", "file": "9953537.html", "available": false}, {"title": "58-59", "file": "9953538.html", "available": false}, {"title": "60-62", "file": "9953539.html", "available": false}, {"title": "63-65", "file": "9953540.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-67", "file": "9953541.html", "available": false}, {"title": "68-70", "file": "9953542.html", "available": false}, {"title": "71-73", "file": "9953543.html", "available": false}, {"title": "74-75", "file": "9953544.html", "available": false}, {"title": "76-77", "file": "9953545.html", "available": false}, {"title": "78-80", "file": "9953546.html", "available": false}, {"title": "81-82", "file": "9953547.html", "available": false}, {"title": "83-85", "file": "9953548.html", "available": false}, {"title": "86-88", "file": "9953549.html", "availabl